    "detailed_description": "You play as Tetrine Reish. Tetrine must find a way to lift the curse plaguing her employer's sister, the Empress' Shadow, before the Shadow succeeds in restoring the old dread empire and crowning herself the next Empress of Aeser.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve puzzles and learn magic in the quest to lift the curse<br></li><li>Choices have lasting consequences and can lead to one of several endings<br></li><li>Other choices affect Tetrine's personality over time<br></li><li>Develop relationships, both friendships and romantic, and make Tetrine to grow as a person<br></li><li>Or play to Tetrine's flaws and see what happens</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You play as Tetrine Reish. Tetrine must find a way to lift the curse plaguing her employer's sister, the Empress' Shadow, before the Shadow succeeds in restoring the old dread empire and crowning herself the next Empress of Aeser.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve puzzles and learn magic in the quest to lift the curse<br></li><li>Choices have lasting consequences and can lead to one of several endings<br></li><li>Other choices affect Tetrine's personality over time<br></li><li>Develop relationships, both friendships and romantic, and make Tetrine to grow as a person<br></li><li>Or play to Tetrine's flaws and see what happens</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Make decisions, learn magic and lift the villain's curse instead of destroying her in this puzzle-adventure visual novel.",
